  "title": "What I actually handed the agent",
  "summary": "I built an internal agent to clean up our CRM. It worked great — until a friend asked me what it was actually authorized to do. When I went and looked, I realized I had handed an autonomous process admin credentials with no expiry, no scoping, and no audit log. This is that story, written down plainly.",
